  "sourceConditions": [
    {
      "id": "src-q16",
      "condition": " $\\triangle\\text{ABC}$는 $\\angle\\text{C}=90^\\circ$인 직각삼각형이고 $\\overline{\\text{CD}}\\perp\\overline{\\text{AB}}$입니다. 그림에서 $\\overline{\\text{AD}}=4\\text{cm}$, $\\overline{\\text{CD}}=6\\text{cm}$, $x=\\overline{\\text{AB}}$입니다.  $\\triangle\\text{ACD}\\sim\\triangle\\text{CBD}$이므로 대응변의 비에서 $\\dfrac{\\overline{\\text{CD}}}{\\overline{\\text{AD}}}=\\dfrac{\\overline{\\text{DB}}}{\\overline{\\text{CD}}}$. 따라서 $\\overline{\\text{CD}}^2=\\overline{\\text{AD}}\\cdot\\overline{\\text{DB}}$입니다.  $6^2=4\\cdot\\overline{\\text{DB}}$이므로 $\\overline{\\text{DB}}=9\\text{cm}$. 따라서 $x=\\overline{\\text{AB}}=\\overline{\\text{AD}}+\\overline{\\text{DB}}=4+9=13\\text{cm}$이고 정답은 ③입니다. ",
      "mappedTo": "mathPlan.nodes;displaySegments;planeMarks"
    },
